SUMMARY:Downtown Asheville Scavenger Hunt 3.0
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nHi everyone! It's time for our F
 all Downtown Asheville Scavenger Hunt 3.0!\n\nBrand new clues and extra bo
 nus questions this time! Whether you're new to the area or know downtown w
 ell\, this is a fun way to explore Asheville and make new friends.\n\n**He
 re's how it works:**\nWe will gather at Bear's Smokehouse at 135 Coxe Aven
 ue at 2:30pm. We’ll hang out for a bit -- plenty of time for a drink or 
 a snack.\nWe will break into teams and go over the rules at 3:15pm. Teams 
 will have 10-15 minutes to review the clues\, and the hunt will begin at 3
 :30pm.\n\nTeams will have an hour to hunt for 40 clues scattered across do
 wntown and take a selfie with each clue. \\*Bonus points for taking a self
 ie with the clue and a willing stranger. More willing strangers = more poi
 nts.\\*\n\nThe hunt ends at 4:30pm back at Bear's.\nIt will take 20-30 min
 utes to review all the teams’ answers and determine the winner.\nThe pri
 ze will be the glory of winning! 🏆\n\n**What to bring:**\n\n* Walking o
 r running shoes (the hunt spans from South Slope to the north end of downt
 own)\n* Your phone for taking pics\n* A pencil or pen to mark off clues as
  you find them\n* Your competitive spirit!\n\n**Parking:**\nParking is ava
 ilable nearby at the Coxe Ave Garage (52 Coxe Ave). Metered street parking
  is also available on various side streets.\n\n**Disclaimer and Release of
  Liability:**\nParticipants are responsible for their safety. If you sign 
 up or participate in this event\, you acknowledge that you freely and volu
 ntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages ar
 ising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event.\n\nLooking f
 orward to seeing y’all there!
